      "timestamp": "2026-05-30T13:56:56.581152",
      "agent_id": "pro_agent",
      "round": 1,
      "text": "We argue that the consumption of red meat increases the risk of colorectal cancer. A clear claim is that red meat consumption is associated with a higher risk of colorectal cancer.",
      "citations": [
        {
          "title": "WHO Classifies Processed Meat as Carcinogenic to Humans",
          "url": "https://www.who.int/news-room/q-and-a/detail/q-and-a-on-the-cause-of-cancer-and-the-evaluation-of-carcinogenicity-of-the-chemical-agent-n-nitroso-diethylamine"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "2026-05-30T13:56:56.911716",
      "agent_id": "con_agent",
      "round": 1,
      "text": "The claim that red meat consumption is associated with a higher risk of colorectal cancer is not universally accepted, as some studies have found no significant correlation.",
      "citations": [
        {
          "title": "Red Meat Consumption and Risk of Colorectal Cancer: A Systematic Review and Meta-Analysis",
          "url": "https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC6325334/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "2026-05-30T13:56:57.271238",
      "agent_id": "pro_agent",
      "round": 2,
      "text": "The claim that some studies have found no significant correlation is misleading, as many meta-analyses have consistently shown a positive association between red meat consumption and colorectal cancer risk.",
      "citations": [
        {
          "title": "Meta-analysis of prospective cohort studies of red meat consumption and colorectal cancer risk",
          "url": "https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC3448444/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "2026-05-30T13:56:57.639945",
      "agent_id": "con_agent",
      "round": 2,
      "text": "The claim that many meta-analyses have consistently shown a positive association is overstated, as the quality of these analyses varies greatly and some have found mixed results.",
      "citations": [
        {
          "title": "Variability in the quality of meta-analyses of red meat and colorectal cancer",
          "url": "https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC6547831/"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "round": 2
